        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Have you ever seen a robot go to college? In China, a robot named Xueba 01 is now a PhD student! He’s going to study at the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Shanghai Theatre Academy",
            "zh": "上海戏剧学院"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", a top art school. People are talking about him online."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The robot is 1.75 metres tall. He looks like a handsome young man. He wears a pair of glasses and a light blue shirt. He can speak Chinese, make different "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "expressions",
            "ref": "v-expression"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and even run. He once won third place in a robot "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "race",
            "ref": "v-race"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "University of Shanghai for Science and Technology",
            "zh": "上海理工大学"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " built him."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This September, the robot will begin a four-year PhD programme. He will study Chinese opera and learn how to act and write plays. He will also learn to design "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "sets",
            "zh": "布景"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for the stage. His teacher, Professor Yang, said that Xueba 01 would work with other students and write a final paper."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Some people are excited about the new robot; others aren’t sure if a robot can truly understand art. Xueba 01 "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "made a joke about",
            "ref": "v-make-a-joke-about"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the question. He said, “If I "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "fail",
            "ref": "v-fail"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", maybe I’ll become a museum piece. That’s not so bad!” No matter what happens, this robot is "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "making history"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
